# Environment Variables
# IMPORTANT: Never commit .env.local or .env*.local files.
# These contain sensitive credentials (API keys, database URLs, etc.)
# Copy .env.example and fill in your local values instead.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
apps/web/.env.local

# Audio files
# For production: either commit audio files to git (good for <500MB total)
# or upload to Netlify Blobs via `npm run upload:audio` and use blob URLs
# Currently: audio files ARE tracked in git (uncommenting below would require Blobs setup)
# /audio/
# apps/web/public/audio/


